        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In BossieBall, you guide a small, cute ball through 9 handcrafted levels that demand precision, timing, and quick reactions to test your skills. Your goal is clear: get the best time, perfect your route, and prove your mastery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All textures and visual elements in the game are either self-made or created with the support of the amazing BossieCommunity. This gives BossieBall a unique look that sets it apart from other skill-based games — fully in the spirit of BossMode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 varied, challenging levels (more coming)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on speedrunning &amp; best times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully self-made or community-created textures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn but challenging gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for speedrunners and precision-focused players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contributors (Textures &amp; Design)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special thanks to everyone who contributed visual elements to the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nyellyie (Shop/Game/Community/Edit – Artist)</strong><br>Complete shop page, Level “Lels Basement” (all textures), Level “The Tower” (all textures)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bossie (Game/Community/Edit – Artist)</strong><br>Level “Bossie Hausen” (all textures), additional textures, Bossie smiley</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saya (Community/Game – Artist)</strong><br>Level “Bossie Town” (all emojis)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An additional thank-you to the <strong>BossieCommunity</strong> for the community images hidden in Level “Bossie Town”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional community members:</strong><br>Nyellyie<br>Bossie<br>Saya<br>Puna<br>Jimmy<br>Simon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Development, Level Design &amp; Additional Textures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>V_Gamer23</strong></p>",
